WEBVTT

NOTE
Voiced by Tello (AI voice). Timings match the voiced video.

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.377
Which of your homes do you look at first?

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:10.288
Title22 runs beside what you already use. It holds no resident health information.

00:00:10.888 --> 00:00:15.269
In the Tello tab, the portfolio briefing puts every home on one screen.

00:00:16.088 --> 00:00:23.328
One row per home, lowest first: checklist, overdue items, expired certifications, open clearances.

00:00:23.928 --> 00:00:27.499
Every number is counted by the app, not guessed by the AI.

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:34.551
In the sandbox, the second row is an illustration: the same home with every open item closed.

00:00:35.151 --> 00:00:37.889
Then a short summary, for someone who has a minute.

00:00:39.851 --> 00:00:45.768
Two of your homes. Thirty days. Press the briefing on day 1 and again on day 30, and compare.

00:00:46.368 --> 00:00:52.733
The 30-Day Proof. No card. Nothing to cancel. hello@title-22.com
